    "description": "Nina Kostyuk, an 18-year-old orphan, dreams of one day owning her own hotel. Determined to build a better future, she begins studying hotel management while working as a housekeeper at the luxurious Paradise Place hotel in the heart of the Carpathian Mountains.\n\nBehind its elegant façade and glamorous atmosphere lies a world of family secrets, jealousy, betrayal and unexpected romance. As Nina becomes involved in the lives of the wealthy family who own the hotel, she discovers that achieving her dreams will be far more complicated than she ever imagined.\n\nIn a place where appearances can be deceiving and trust is hard to find, Nina must overcome countless challenges, fight for her happiness and discover where she truly belongs.",
